   "html": "<p>Filled with an exclusive guest list of the critically acclaimed documentary’s closest friends, partners and colleagues, we decked out a Hollywood Hills estate to immerse attendees in a disco-tinged, volcano-inspired atmosphere. </p>\n<p>We amplified the mansion’s existing features, creating a fiery red-lit driveway arrival and highlighted the black rock waterfall with additional moody lighting. Inside, the space was decorated to encourage guests to explore and enjoy while DJs <strong>A-TRAK</strong>, <strong>GODDOLLARS</strong>, and <strong>Bianca Lexis</strong> set the tone. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "VENUE & LOGISTICS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>IHC oversaw event production from top to bottom to ensure a seamless and exclusive experience. Guests were directed to check-in at an offsite location where they would board a shuttle that drove them to the house. Once they arrived, guests were escorted by staff with umbrellas to walk up the fiery red-lit driveway. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Then guests were ushered inside to the exciting evening that awaited them. Specialty cocktails and a selection of hand-made finger foods by Travis Hayden, including late night grilled cheeses, kept guests satisfied all night long.</p>"
    },
